{{!
    @template block_oksigeniatembiapo/alert

    One line of «To sort out», inside its list item: how pressing it is (a mark, not a loud badge: the urgent come first
    and in bold), the service it is from, with the logo of its product, what to do, and the way to where it is done. The
    whole line is the link.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * text - what is waiting, in plain text
    * url - where it is sorted out
    * urgent, levellabel - whether it is urgent, and the word for its level, for screen readers
    * service, serviceicon - the name of the service and the address of its logo

    Example context (json):
    {
        "text": "One screen has given no sign of life since 9:12", "url": "#", "level": "urgent", "urgent": true,
        "levellabel": "Urgent", "service": "Screens", "servicekey": "local_example",
        "serviceicon": "https://moodle.example/blocks/oksigeniatembiapo/pix/generic.svg"
    }
}}
<a class="tbp-todo-link" href="{{url}}">
    <span class="tbp-mark">{{#urgent}}<svg class="tbp-mark-urgent" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle class="tbp-mark-disc" cx="10" cy="10" r="8.25"/><path d="M10 5.75v5"/><circle class="tbp-mark-dot" cx="10" cy="14.1" r="1.1"/></svg>{{/urgent}}{{^urgent}}<svg class="tbp-mark-today" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="7.25"/><path d="M10 6.25V10l2.6 1.6"/></svg>{{/urgent}}<span class="tbp-sr">{{levellabel}}, </span></span>
    <span class="tbp-tag"><span class="tbp-plate tbp-plate-mini" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{serviceicon}}" alt="" width="16" height="16"></span><span class="tbp-tag-name">{{service}}</span><span class="tbp-sr">: </span></span>
    <span class="tbp-todo-text">{{text}}</span>
    <span class="tbp-todo-go" aria-hidden="true"><span class="tbp-todo-go-label">{{#str}}resolve, block_oksigeniatembiapo{{/str}}</span><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" focusable="false"><path d="M6 3.5L10.5 8 6 12.5"/></svg></span>
</a>
